        <mxCell id="cer1-formula" value="&lt;div style='text-align:left;font-family:Helvetica;'&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:13px;'&gt;CER の計算&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;S (置換): 都→と = 1&lt;br/&gt;D (削除) = 0, I (挿入) = 0&lt;br/&gt;N (正解文字数) = 6&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;b style='font-size:14px; color:#E65100;'&gt;CER = 1 / 6 ≈ 16.7%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
